---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL, sitePath } from "../lib/site";
const providers = ["Claude Code", "Codex", "Cursor", "Grok", "OpenCode", "Antigravity"];
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="edition"><span>EST. BEFORE DAWN</span><span>COMMUNITY FORK / VOL. 001</span></div>
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span>THE VILLAGE IS ASLEEP. YOUR IDEAS AREN’T.</p>
      <h1>GOOD CODE.<br />GREAT <em>AURA.</em><br /><span>ALL WOOD.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">Meet Tung Tung Tung Code. A serious home for your coding agents, with an extremely unserious wooden supervisor.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="action action-primary" href={sitePath("/download")}>Enter the village ↗</a><a class="action action-quiet" href={GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}>Inspect the source ↗</a></div>
      <p class="fine-print">Bring your own agents. Keep your subscriptions. Find the secrets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="guardian-stage">
      <span class="stage-moon" aria-hidden="true">☾</span><span class="stage-number" aria-hidden="true">03:33</span>
      <button class="guardian" id="guardian" aria-label="Knock on the wooden guardian"><img src={sitePath("/sahur-guardian.svg")} alt="A smiling wooden guardian holding a bat beneath the moon" width="450" height="600" fetchpriority="high" /></button>
      <div class="specimen-label"><span>SPECIMEN 001 / THE NIGHT WATCH</span><strong>100% WOOD. 0% CHILL.</strong><span id="knock-status" role="status">He’s not a bug. He’s a feature. Try knocking.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><span>ONE WORKSPACE. MANY AGENTS. QUESTIONABLE LORE.</span><a href="#workspace">SCROLL TO AWAKEN ↓</a></div>
  </section>
  <div class="chant-strip" aria-hidden="true"><span>TUNG.</span><span>TUNG.</span><span>TUNG.</span><span class="chant-sahur">SAHUR!</span></div>
  <section id="workspace" class="workspace section-pad">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE ACTUAL SOFTWARE</p><h2>Brainrot outside.<br /><em>Real tools inside.</em></h2><p>The joke is the branding. Not the workspace. Built on the open-source T3 Code foundation, with its coding-agent workflow intact.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Your agents.<br />Your subscriptions.</h3><p>Bring your existing provider accounts. Switch between coding agents without turning your desktop into a village of terminal windows.</p><div class="provider-list">{providers.map(provider => <span>{provider}</span>)}</div></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>From first knock<br />to final diff.</h3><p>Projects, threads, terminals, code reviews, and checkpoints. The same capable workspace, now wearing warm timber tones.</p><a href={sitePath("/download")}>Build it from source ↗</a></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Quiet by default.<br />Loud by choice.</h3><p>Seventeen app discoveries. Optional synthesized knocks. No autoplay, no remote meme assets, and no forever-running mascot animations.</p><a href="#secrets">Investigate the lore ↓</a></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="secrets" class="lore section-pad">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE VILLAGE HAS SECRETS</p><h2>Some features<br />aren’t in<br /><em>the changelog.</em></h2><p>Open ☾ SAHUR inside the app. Knock three times. Type a familiar chant outside the editor. Visit when the world is quiet.</p><p class="lore-small">There are 17 app discoveries. This website has its own little collection, too.</p><button class="moon-button" id="secret-moon" aria-label="Tap the secret moon">☾ <span>THE MOON IS LISTENING</span></button></div>
    <div class="lore-board"><span class="board-label">FIELD NOTES / DO NOT DISTURB</span><p class="field-note">“If the wooden man knocks three times and you don’t answer, he opens another pull request.”</p><div class="discovery-count"><strong id="site-secret-count">0</strong><span>/ 6 WEBSITE SECRETS</span></div><p id="site-secret-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Not everything needs to be documented.</p><details><summary>A small nudge?</summary><ul><li>The guardian likes three knocks. And 33.</li><li>The moon counts to seven.</li><li>Try typing sahur or tungtungtung outside a text field.</li><li>The ancient ↑ ↑ ↓ ↓ ← → ← → B A ritual still works.</li></ul></details></div>
  </section>
  <section class="closing section-pad"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT GREAT IDEA IS STILL AWAKE.</p><h2>Answer<br /><em>the knock.</em></h2><a class="action action-primary" href={sitePath("/download")}>Get Tung Tung Tung Code ↗</a><span class="closing-note">OPEN SOURCE. WOODEN HEART.</span></section>
</Layout>
<script>
  const found = new Set<string>();
  let knocks = 0;
  let moons = 0;
  let buffer: string[] = [];
  const status = document.getElementById("site-secret-status");
  const count = document.getElementById("site-secret-count");
  function discover(key: string, message: string) {
    found.add(key);
    if (status) status.textContent = message;
    if (count) count.textContent = String(found.size);
  }
  document.getElementById("guardian")?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    knocks += 1;
    const label = document.getElementById("knock-status");
    if (label) label.textContent = knocks % 3 === 0 ? "TUNG. TUNG. TUNG. SAHUR!" : `${knocks} knock${knocks === 1 ? "" : "s"}. The village is listening.`;
    if (knocks === 3) discover("knock", "Three knocks. The guardian knows you now.");
    if (knocks === 33) discover("marathon", "33 knocks. You have been promoted to village supervisor.");
  });
  document.getElementById("secret-moon")?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    moons += 1;
    if (moons === 7) discover("moon", "Seven moon taps. One very patient moon.");
  });
  document.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
    if (event.isComposing || event.repeat || event.ctrlKey || event.metaKey || event.altKey || (event.target instanceof Element && event.target.closest("input, textarea, select, [contenteditable]:not([contenteditable='false']), [role='textbox']"))) { buffer = []; return; }
    buffer = [...buffer, event.key.length === 1 ? event.key.toLowerCase() : event.key].slice(-12);
    const joined = buffer.join("");
    if (joined.endsWith("sahur")) discover("chant", "SAHUR! The whole village heard that.");
    if (joined.endsWith("tungtungtung")) discover("rhythm", "+1,000 wooden aura. Deploy responsibly.");
    if (buffer.slice(-10).join(" ") === "ArrowUp ArrowUp ArrowDown ArrowDown ArrowLeft ArrowRight ArrowLeft ArrowRight b a") discover("konami", "Ancient ritual complete. The wooden council approves.");
  });
</script>
<style>
  .hero { max-width: 1440px; margin: auto; padding: 24px 5% 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .edition { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .18em; color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .hero-copy { padding: 76px 0 50px; z-index: 1; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .17em; font-weight: 700; }
  .status-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; display: inline-block; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); margin-right: 8px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(64px, 7.9vw, 114px); font-weight: 900; line-height: .94; letter-spacing: -.075em; margin: 32px 0; }
  h1 em, h2 em { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--accent); }
  h1 > span { color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .hero-description { max-width: 410px; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; margin-top: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .action { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding: 15px 24px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .action-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #241b13; border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 3px; }
  .action-primary:hover { background: #f6cc88; }
  .action-quiet { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .fine-print { font-size: 10px; margin-top: 22px; color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .guardian-stage { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; background: #d0ad75; color: #35251a; margin: 35px 0 40px 20px; border-radius: 200px 200px 3px 3px; min-height: 580px; }
  .guardian { border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 0; width: 100%; max-width: 390px; position: relative; z-index: 1; transition: transform 120ms; }
  .guardian:active { transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  .guardian img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .stage-moon { position: absolute; top: 32px; right: 55px; font: 100px Georgia, serif; opacity: .45; }
  .stage-number { position: absolute; top: 120px; left: 23px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .2em; writing-mode: vertical-rl; }
  .specimen-label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #8c6c43; width: 100%; }
  .specimen-label > span:first-child { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .2em; }
  .specimen-label strong { font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  #knock-status { font-size: 10px; min-height: 16px; }
  .hero-bottom { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 22px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .chant-strip { display: flex; justify-content: space-evenly; gap: 10px; padding: 25px 3%; background: var(--accent); color: #241b13; font-size: clamp(25px, 5.5vw, 80px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: 1; }
  .chant-sahur { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; }
  .section-pad { max-width: 1440px; margin: auto; padding: 100px 5%; }
  .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px 80px; align-items: end; }
  .section-heading > .eyebrow { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 70px); line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.055em; margin: 15px 0 25px; }
  .section-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 380px; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 15px; }
  .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin-top: 50px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .feature-grid article { padding: 32px 30px 0 0; }
  .feature-grid article + article { padding-left: 30px; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .feature-grid article > span { color: var(--accent); font-size: 10px; }
  h3 { font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.04em; font-weight: 600; }
  .feature-grid p { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .feature-grid a { font-size: 12px; }
  .provider-list { display: flex; gap: 8px 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 22px; }
  .provider-list span { font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent); }
  .lore { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 90px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .lore > div > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--fg-muted); max-width: 390px; font-size: 14px; }
  .lore-small { font-size: 11px !important; }
  .moon-button { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; margin-top: 35px; border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 8px 0; color: var(--accent); font: 50px Georgia, serif; }
  .moon-button span { font: 9px var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .15em; }
  .lore-board { background: #ebe0c8; color: #35251a; padding: 38px; align-self: center; transform: rotate(2deg); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #100b0750; }
  .board-label { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .15em; border-bottom: 1px solid #ac987c; display: block; padding-bottom: 20px; }
  .lore .field-note { color: #35251a !important; font: italic 29px/1.35 Georgia, serif !important; margin: 30px 0; }
  .discovery-count { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #ac987c; padding-top: 12px; }
  .discovery-count strong { font-size: 52px; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .discovery-count span { font-size: 9px; }
  #site-secret-status { color: #674e37; font-size: 12px; min-height: 40px; }
  details { border-top: 1px solid #ac987c; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 11px; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; }
  details ul { padding-left: 18px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .closing { text-align: center; padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 110px; }
  .closing h2 { font-size: clamp(70px, 12vw, 160px); margin: 30px 0 40px; }
  .closing-note { display: block; margin-top: 30px; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .2em; color: var(--fg-muted); }
  @media (min-width: 1440px) { h1 { font-size: 114px; } }
  @media (max-width: 850px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .hero-copy { padding-top: 45px; } h1 { font-size: 64px; } .guardian-stage { min-height: 470px; margin-left: 10px; } .edition { font-size: 7px; } .hero-description { font-size: 14px; } .section-heading, .lore { gap: 35px; } .feature-grid article { padding-right: 15px; } .feature-grid article + article { padding-left: 15px; } h3 { font-size: 23px; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .hero { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 18px 6% 0; } .edition { gap: 12px; } .hero-copy { padding: 35px 0 10px; } h1 { font-size: clamp(62px, 15vw, 90px); } .hero-description { max-width: 330px; } .guardian-stage { margin: 30px 0; min-height: 0; max-width: 360px; align-self: center; width: 100%; } .guardian { max-width: 280px; } .hero-bottom { font-size: 7px; } .hero-bottom a { white-space: nowrap; } .section-pad { padding: 65px 6%; } .section-heading, .lore { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 25px; } .feature-grid article, .feature-grid article + article { padding: 25px 0; border-left: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); } .lore-board { transform: none; padding: 26px; } .lore .field-note { font-size: 26px !important; } }
</style>
